-- title:
--   Torsion-free normal subgroup of finite index in ProjAwayUnits
-- statement:
--   Let $a,b$ be rationals and $q'$ a prime such that `IsDefiniteRamifiedExactlyAt a b q'` holds for the quaternion algebra $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]$, i.e. $a<0$, $b<0$, and for every height-one prime $v$ of $\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}$ the algebra $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]\otimes_{\mathbb{Q}}\mathbb{Q}_v$ has all its nonzero elements invertible exactly when $q'$ lies in $v$. Let $N$ be a nonzero natural number and $R$ a $\mathbb{Z}$-submodule of $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]$ which is an Eichler order of level $N$, that is, $R=\Lambda_1\cap\Lambda_2$ for two maximal orders $\Lambda_1,\Lambda_2$ with the relative index of the additive group of $R$ in that of $\Lambda_1$ equal to $N$. Let $r$ be a prime with $r\neq q'$ and $r\nmid N$, and let $v$ be a height-one prime of $\mathcal{O}_{\mathbb{Q}}$ containing $r$. Write $\mathrm{awayUnits}\,R\,v$ for the subgroup of $\mathbb{H}[\mathbb{Q},a,b]^{\times}$ consisting of those units whose image under `toLoc w` lies in the subgroup generated by [`Submodule.localBoxUnits R w`](def/Submodule_LocalBox.html#L45) for every height-one prime $w\neq v$, and let $\mathrm{ProjAwayUnits}\,R\,v$ be its quotient by the kernel of its permutation action on `Vert R v`. The assertion is that this quotient group has a normal subgroup $\Gamma'$ of finite index all of whose elements of finite order are trivial.
--
--   This is the standard torsion-freeness input for the action of the projective $r$-unit group of a definite Eichler order on the Bruhat–Tits tree at $r$: a cocompact discrete subgroup of $\mathrm{PGL}_2(\mathbb{Q}_r)$ contains a torsion-free normal subgroup of finite index, in the style of Minkowski's lemma. It feeds the construction of quotients of the tree used on the Čerednik–Drinfeld side, being cited in the refinement that intersects such a subgroup with the type-preserving subgroup of $\mathrm{awayUnits}$.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_CerednikDrinfeld_CosetGraph_exists_normal_finiteIndex_forall_isOfFinOrder_imp_eq_one.lean

